WEBVTT

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.980
Why didn't you believe me?

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:12.360
Was it all a lie?

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.020
You were...

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:19.700
You were the only one for me, Setsuna!

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:31.960
What was that?

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:06.480
<b>The right way to spin dreams</b>

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:18.280
They're too rich 
if all this is their private beach.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:21.540
No matter how much I do, it never ends.

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:30.700
Move your hands instead of 
your lips, you freeloader!

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:33.480
We're both servants, remember?

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.000
This is just my part-time job.

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:36.970
Damn it.

00:02:36.970 --> 00:02:38.470
Vengeful spirit, disperse!

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:37.860
<b>Vengeful Spirit Disperse</b>

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.820
Trying to grab Karen when you have me...

00:02:42.820 --> 00:02:44.890
What's this about having you?

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:47.140
Who the hell decided that?

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:51.100
That's enough fun and games. 
Let's get started on the plan!p

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.310
Yeah, you're right.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:57.390
Hang on. Aren't you forgetting 
whose plan this is?

00:02:57.390 --> 00:02:59.240
Yes, good for you.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:19.920
Is this really gonna lure Rinne out here?

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.480
Drawing the goddess out of Amano Iwato

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:27.350
is best done with dancing girls 
rather than by force.

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:31.940
Once she sees how much fun we're having, 
Rinne will get curious and come outside.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.080
Okay, let's try it.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.860
<b>Kya Kya Ufufu</b>

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.860
That's the spirit!

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:51.990
Hey, wait!

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:56.250
I've caught two lovely girls.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.950
Setsuna, you're stronger than I thought.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:01.880
Can I hang from your arm?

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.280
As you please.

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:05.890
I'm not that weak little boy anymore.

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:07.350
Yay!

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:08.720
Me, too!

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:10.840
I love you both!

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:12.810
I love you, too!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:14.890
Let's kiss him together!

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:19.730
A dream?

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:24.860
Yeah, a dream.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.870
Setsuna, you're wonderful!

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:37.500
She's not coming out.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:38.770
<b>Make it sexy!</b>

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.440
Maybe it's not stimulating enough.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:41.010
<b>Like you're having fun!</b>

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:54.140
I'll return it!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.400
Oh, my...

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:07.570
Hey, how dare you bury
your face in Sara's chest!

00:05:07.570 --> 00:05:09.270
Sorry, sorry!

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:12.900
I don't mind! Rub your 
face around some more!

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:18.740
Karen, your next line is, "If you're gonna bury 
your face in someone's chest, bury it in mine!"

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.410
Nice and loud now.

00:05:21.410 --> 00:05:23.370
You can suck on it, too, Setsuna.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:24.340
I'm not saying that!

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:24.340
<b>Kya Kya Ufufu 
Script</b>

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:29.350
I must be hearing things.

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:33.640
Setsuna, oil me up!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.360
Get me nice and slippery!

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:41.360
Hearing things, hearing things...

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:47.980
No, not there...

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:50.150
Are you sure I should stop?

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:51.370
Meanie...

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:56.920
Setsuna-san, you haven't oiled <i>all</i> of me yet.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:00.380
Like here, under my swimsuit.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.170
You sure you want my hand in there?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.590
No, of course not!

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:08.090
Whose beach do they think that is? Jeez!

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:16.770
It's the mistress's job to 
correct her servants' conduct.

00:06:22.420 --> 00:06:24.360
We're out of stuff to say.

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:27.360
And Rinne didn't show!

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:29.450
You're gonna get a sunburn!

00:06:29.450 --> 00:06:31.150
Let me run some suntan lotion on you.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:33.110
Huh? I don't need that from you!

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.330
You can do me, then.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.960
Okay, sure.

00:06:37.960 --> 00:06:39.210
Hey!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:41.960
Rinne!

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:54.810
What happened to cleaning up the beach?

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:11.720
Crewman Karen, it's a mysterious creature!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.850
It may be one of Cthulhu's minions!

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:19.660
C-Commander, that minion... 
It's the shadow over Innsmouth!

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:23.760
I made it outside.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:26.170
It was much easier than I thought.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:28.420
Good.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:30.170
<b>Kya Kya Ufufu 
Script</b>

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:34.440
Were you guys acting to try 
to get me to come out?

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:37.720
Well, you see... How do I put it?

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.620
I kind of knew.

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.590
Knew what?

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:43.720
That I don't have soot blight syndrome.

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:45.440
But...

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.440
Let's take our time.

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:50.940
Thank you.

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:54.150
Man, it sure is hot!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:56.300
Summer. Summer is here.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:59.840
There's so much sound and light, 
nothing like the night.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.700
It shines so beautifully.

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:10.960
You don't need to rush yourself.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:15.090
Yeah, but don't worry.

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:21.100
C-Crewman Karen!

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.860
This place is haunted!

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:29.730
What are they doing?

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.590
I'll go check on them.

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.410
What are you doing?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.330
It's dangerous! Be careful, Crewman Setsuna!

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.040
Huh?

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.370
Look at that suspicious abandoned shack!

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:48.500
Will a demon come out or a snake?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.480
It's so exciting!

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:53.790
How are things, Crewman Karen?

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:57.090
No signs of beasts or suspicious persons!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.180
Excellent! Forward, Crewman Setsuna!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.180
So that's what we're playing?

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:07.190
Commander Sara, I've found the entrance!

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:09.270
Good work, Crewman Karen!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:12.590
Hey, rookie, open the door!

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:14.200
Okay, okay.

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:17.050
It <i>is</i> rather suspicious.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:22.700
What do they think they're 
doing, leaving me by myself?

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.190
Looks like it's locked.

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:32.070
Since it's on the Ohara estate, 
it must be their property.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:36.240
But it doesn't seem to be a summer 
house or anything like that.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:39.030
Could there be unimaginable riches inside?

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:40.650
Keep dreaming.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:41.930
What are you doing—

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:51.440
What... is that?

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.760
I bet you could kick it open, Karen.

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:57.320
Are you still mad about this morning?

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:00.820
Okay, let's all hit it together!

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:03.580
Okay, understood, Commander Sara!

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:06.000
What? For real?

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:08.710
Ready...

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.000
Stop!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.010
Rinne!

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:22.680
Rinne!

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:42.570
I'm glad it isn't soot blight syndrome.

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.310
But why did she have a panic attack?

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:48.000
Did she have some mental stress?

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.670
She fainted when we were about 
to break down the door.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:56.230
There must be some secret 
inside that abandoned shack.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:01.600
Don't ask Rinne anything about it.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:02.760
Why not?

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:06.850
She had a panic attack and fainted 
just from us trying to open the door.

00:11:07.380 --> 00:11:10.850
Just let her be until 
she's ready to tell us.

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:14.360
Can I show you two something?

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.070
What's that?

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.460
My journal from since I came to this island.

00:11:25.460 --> 00:11:27.200
Why are you keeping a journal?

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:32.230
I thought it might help 
me get my memory back.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:37.710
It's become a notebook of all the strange 
things I've seen on this island.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:41.090
What's the deal with this island?

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.640
There's that strange soot blight 
syndrome which only occurs here.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.100
<b>Soot Blight Syndrome
 Pain Relief</b>

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:48.020
Why doesn't it exist anywhere else?

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:54.600
And the island's strange legends... 
How much are they based in fact?

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:58.110
Who is that girl I keep seeing in my dreams?

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:00.440
Have I met Rinne before?

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:04.740
Are we reincarnations of the 
two people in the legend?

00:12:05.110 --> 00:12:09.190
Am I sure I crossed time to get here 
when I can't remember anything?

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:14.830
Oh, so you don't totally believe my theory?

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.410
That's not really what I mean.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.470
Anyway, soot blight syndrome, the legends,

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:24.340
Rinne, and my lost memories...

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:30.850
I feel as though it's all connected, 
but I don't know how.

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:34.600
"Setsuna" must be the key to it all.

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.520
And am I really "Setsuna"?

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:41.780
Sorry, but I'm getting really confused.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.720
I bet.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:53.410
Oh, man.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:56.170
I'm tired from thinking too hard.

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:14.770
Is that you, Rinne?

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:18.150
Why is a servant bathing first?

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:20.790
Are you feeling better?

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:23.080
We were really worried when 
you suddenly fainted.

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:25.400
Sorry, I'm okay now.

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.280
Glad to hear it.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.410
I remembered something.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:35.960
I used to meet a boy named 
Setsuna at that shack.

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:41.450
No one on the island knew about him.

00:13:43.370 --> 00:13:47.590
But every night I went, 
Setsuna would be there.

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.360
Was that me?

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:54.550
I can't remember anything more.

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:57.810
Not even what that Setsuna looked like.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:03.860
To me, you are that Setsuna, 
and that's all that matters.

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:07.990
That's all that matters, huh?

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:08.950
Yeah.

00:14:11.110 --> 00:14:12.520
I like it that way.

00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:16.100
I see.

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:26.010
<i>I'm waiting to meet you someday</i>

00:14:26.370 --> 00:14:31.050
<i>At this promised place</i>

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:35.180
<i>I keep to my heart</i>

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:47.650
<i>The dreams and hopes that
I want to make come true with you</i>

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:58.020
<i>No matter how much time passes</i>

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:02.920
<i>The memories will never fade</i>

00:15:02.920 --> 00:15:09.670
<i>I'll search for them
and find them every time</i>

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:16.120
<i>No matter what our fate may be</i>

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:22.710
<i>I'll take this hand of yours</i>

00:15:22.710 --> 00:15:27.710
<i>And never let go</i>

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:33.510
<i>I want to walk down the path to the future</i>

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:37.210
<i>with you</i>

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.930
Done!

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:41.770
Okay, let's see how many you got right.

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:46.020
Good, looks like you'll pass.

00:16:46.020 --> 00:16:47.650
Yes!

00:16:48.260 --> 00:16:50.150
It's pretty late.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.930
I'll walk you home, since it's dark.

00:16:52.930 --> 00:16:54.070
Oh...

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:57.700
I don't want to go home.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.830
Oh, you're in love with me?

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:04.400
No, that's not what I meant!

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:05.750
Fine, then.

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.890
My mother's a real weirdo.

00:17:15.480 --> 00:17:16.710
Weirdo?

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:19.960
She said she was doing some kind of 
research and shut herself in her room.

00:17:19.960 --> 00:17:23.030
She never paid any attention to me.

00:17:23.030 --> 00:17:25.640
She and my dad fought all the time.

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:31.170
He finally ended up kicking her 
out, so she went to the mainland.

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:34.860
Do you miss her?

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:38.400
I don't know, but I want to see her.

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:40.430
Where did she go on the mainland?

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:41.790
I dunno.

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:48.250
But Tarou... The resident officer said 
he ran into her at a university there.

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.470
I bet I could see her if I wanted to.

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:51.800
I see.

00:17:55.490 --> 00:18:00.280
If I prayed at Sara's shrine, maybe I could 
fly across the sea and meet Otohime.

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:01.720
What are you talking about now?

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:04.640
The shrine's object of 
worship is a treasure box.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.310
A treasure box?

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:08.970
There's supposedly a mummy inside.

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:12.400
That's pretty weird.

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:15.320
What were you doing out so late?

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:18.400
Is it true you have a part-time 
job at the Ohara mansion?

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:21.940
No, today I asked her.

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:23.050
What are you doing with him?

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:27.290
It is your duty to marry and 
carry on the Kurutsu line!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:29.100
Hey, what's that all about?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:30.370
Leave it.

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.520
Please don't ask.

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:32.970
But, you...

00:18:32.970 --> 00:18:34.130
Leave it alone.

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:37.090
Since you already know, I'll clue you in.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.760
You're right. I'm working 
at the Ohara mansion.

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.390
How dare you?!

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:44.250
I've got things I want to do!

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.310
I'm not going to let you
boss me around!

00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:51.310
Wait, Karen!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.130
Yo.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:03.050
Oh, Setsuna-san.

00:19:03.050 --> 00:19:04.930
What are you doing out so late?

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:06.990
I was thirsty.

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:09.680
Okay, I'll buy you a drink.

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:11.330
Do you have any money?

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.380
I got paid.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.840
Then I'll gladly take you up on your offer.

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:20.760
Did something happen?

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:25.290
Well, I saw a fight between 
Karen and her dad.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.260
Again?

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:32.370
Why's her dad so opposed 
to her leaving the island?

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:35.010
He wants her to continue the family line.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:37.530
The line passes through 
the female descendants.

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.630
That's so stupid.

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:41.560
I can't believe stuff 
like that still happens.

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:47.040
More importantly, does Karen 
really want to leave the island?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:51.080
If she seriously wanted to, 
she must have had many opportunities.

00:19:52.010 --> 00:19:54.040
Yeah, the other day...

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:04.010
It seems like she's just
rebelling against her father.

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:08.850
Maybe she isn't succeeding 
because she isn't serious about it.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:10.950
You don't sugarcoat things.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:15.370
Even if she left the island, 
I'm not sure that she'd be happy.

00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:16.480
Why not?

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:23.540
I'd question how much thought Karen has 
given to what happens after she leaves.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:28.250
Well, couldn't she think 
about that after she leaves?

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:33.640
Moving away with no clear objective 
won't accomplish anything.

00:20:34.280 --> 00:20:38.900
If it seems pointless, you need to 
be able do what you want to do.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:41.350
That's pretty important, I think.

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:43.370
I don't agree.

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:45.500
Really?

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:46.740
Really.

00:20:47.910 --> 00:20:49.060
Are you sure?

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:06.530
Oh, it's the degenerate.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:07.860
No, I'm not!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:11.210
Tell Karen not to skip summer school.

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:11.950
Huh?

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.210
She's working at the mansion today, right?

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:18.050
No, she didn't come today 
because she had summer school.

00:21:18.050 --> 00:21:19.690
What? Really?

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:36.280
Hey, Karen, did you skip summer school?

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:39.900
We spent a lot of time studying.

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:45.240
If you don't get it together, 
you won't be able to leave the island.

00:21:54.870 --> 00:21:56.620
Wh-What are you...

00:21:57.240 --> 00:21:58.750
Please...

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:02.960
Mess me up!

